'''Misa Ono & Doge''' (小野ミサ＆わんこ) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Get On! Kyoto City Subway Collaboration Event]]. They were added in [[Version 7.0 Update|Version 7.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Misa Ono & Doge
|image = E 404.png
|appearance = [[Get On! Kyoto City Subway Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 800円 - 3,160円
}}

==Enemy==
She sports average health, attack power, and movement speed. However, she has a 100% chance to [[Freeze|freeze]] Cat Units for 3.33 seconds, along with a range of 480, which can make her quite formidable.

==Strategy==
There are two strategies to consistently beat her, one being to get a unit that outranges her, and the other is to have a unit immune to freeze. Even without these, it's not hard to beat her, due to her lackluster stats.

